  <div class="intro"><div class="eyebrow">RIPL WEALTH · IMPORTANT INFORMATION</div><h1>Disclosures</h1>
  <p class="lede">Important information about RIPL Wealth, our website, investment risks, and the limitations of educational material and financial-planning discussions.</p>
  <p class="small">Prepared for compliance review · {lastReviewed}. These website disclosures supplement, and do not replace, RIPL's current Form ADV, relationship summary, advisory agreement, and other required client documents.</p>
  <div class="note"><strong>Please read before making an investment decision.</strong> Website information is general education, not personalized advice or a recommendation to buy or sell a security. No investment outcome, tax savings, income level, or protection against loss is guaranteed. The suitability of any strategy depends on individual circumstances.</div></div>
